MDI-QKD via dephasing channels
In this section we consider two dephasing channels~\eqref{eq:ds} between Alice and Charlie and Bob and Charlie. We will again observe that the operation of distillation and \textit{iid} entanglement swapping via Bell measurement do not commute. Altering them leads to different amount of key in the output.
We will use the fact that MDI-QKD via dephasing channel is teleportation-covariant.


